  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 花哞菇\" width=\"100%\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=請我喝杯咖啡&amp;color=5b9c51&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"請我喝杯咖啡\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=成為贊助者&amp;color=5b9c51&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;label=加入我們的Discord&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我們的Discord\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Wiki&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Wiki\"> </a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Friends&amp;Foes - 花哞菇是Friends&amp;Foes模組的一個小型附加元件，為每朵花新增了一種花哞菇變種。花哞菇可以在草原和花森林生態域中找到。你可以查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\" rel=\"nofollow\">wiki</a>以獲取更多關於花哞菇的資訊。</span></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">🐮 花哞菇變種</span></p><hr><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">紫紅球花</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">矢車菊</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_allium.png\" alt=\"紫紅球花哞菇\" width=\"133\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_azure_bluet.png\" alt=\"矢車菊哞菇\" width=\"146\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">藍色蘭花</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">矢車菊</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_blue_orchid.png\" alt=\"藍色蘭花哞菇\" width=\"149\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_cornflower.png\" alt=\"矢車菊哞菇\" width=\"139\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">蒲公英</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">紫丁香</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_dandelion.png\" alt=\"蒲公英哞菇\" width=\"149\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lilac.png\" alt=\"紫丁香哞菇\" width=\"144\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">鈴蘭</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">橙色鬱金香</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lily_of_the_valley.png\" alt=\"鈴蘭哞菇\" width=\"140\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_orange_tulip.png\" alt=\"橙色鬱金香哞菇\" width=\"137\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">雛菊</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">牡丹</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_oxeye_daisy.png\" alt=\"雛菊哞菇\" width=\"134\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_peony.png\" alt=\"牡丹哞菇\" width=\"150\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">粉紅色鬱金香</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">罌粟</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_pink_tulip.png\" alt=\"粉紅色鬱金香哞菇\" width=\"137\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_poppy.png\" alt=\"罌粟哞菇\" width=\"142\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">紅色鬱金香</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">玫瑰叢</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_red_tulip.png\" alt=\"紅色鬱金香哞菇\" width=\"137\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_rose_bush.png\" alt=\"玫瑰叢哞菇\" width=\"142\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">向日葵</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">白色鬱金香</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_sunflower.png\" alt=\"向日葵哞菇\" width=\"150\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_white_tulip.png\" alt=\"白色鬱金香哞菇\" width=\"137\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">⚙️ 其他附加元件 / 資料包</span></p><hr><ul>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - 養蜂人小屋</a></li>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">重製結構 - Friends and Foes 相容資料包</a></li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">💬 社群</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎<a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的Discord伺服器社群</a>聊天、分享你的創作、提出任何問題，或只是獲取模組最新開發資訊並在新版本推出時收到通知。也請不要猶豫，<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">透過GitHub問題回報任何崩潰或錯誤</a>。</span></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">👋 支持</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">無論是否有任何支持，我都會繼續開發我的模組，因為這是我的愛好，儘管我的大部分閒暇時間都投入到模組的開發中。所以如果你無論如何都想支持我，可以透過<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>或<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a>。話雖如此，我非常感謝你們所有的支持。</span></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">📜 許可證</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組採用<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms%252fmaster%252fLICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a>許可證。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎查閱我的程式碼，了解我在編寫此模組時如何實現和解決各種問題，並將程式碼片段融入你自己的程式碼中。也歡迎在任何模組包中使用此模組（不過若能註明出處並連結回此頁面，我們將非常感激）。</span></p>",
